  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Nutrition Sensitive Agricultural Diversification to Fight Malnutrition and Enhance Youth Employment Opportunities in Eastern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims at creating decent employment opportunities for young women and men in the agricultural sector in order to: (i) improve their income and own access to food; (ii) increase the availability of locally produced eggs and fish, and improve their access for vulnerable children through school feeding programmes, and (iii) increase the overall productive capacities of both the poultry and aquaculture value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
